00:30:49.747 --> 00:30:52.177
"you might as well sell
all your shit first,

00:30:52.177 --> 00:30:54.057
"don't take a hit first,
sell all your shit first.

00:30:54.057 --> 00:30:55.597
"Sell your car, sell your bass guitar,

00:30:55.597 --> 00:30:58.227
"sell your shoes, sell
your watches, your rings,

00:30:58.227 --> 00:31:01.247
"your coats, all your laundry,
coats, sell all your shit,

00:31:01.247 --> 00:31:03.630
"and then take a hit,
'cause once you take a hit,"

00:31:03.630 --> 00:31:05.650
once I take a motherfuckin' hit,

00:31:05.650 --> 00:31:08.763
I don't know, once I exhale, once I,

00:31:08.763 --> 00:31:10.620
(Louis inhales and exhales)

00:31:10.620 --> 00:31:13.910
all bets are off, I don't know
what the fuck I'm gon' do.

00:31:13.910 --> 00:31:15.670
But thank God, this
birthday, I'm not gon' have

00:31:15.670 --> 00:31:18.490
no money for that kinda shit,
'cause I gotta pay my rent.

00:31:18.490 --> 00:31:21.390
And I'm so glad I could
talk to you guys again.

00:31:21.390 --> 00:31:23.640
I hope I helped somebody
with some of my bullshit.

00:31:23.640 --> 00:31:26.470
To me it's all bullshit,
but it's all the truth.

00:31:26.470 --> 00:31:27.303
And,

00:31:29.352 --> 00:31:30.677
I don' feel like makin' up rhymes.

00:31:30.677 --> 00:31:31.970
I don't know, I came here today,

00:31:31.970 --> 00:31:33.720
I really didn't feel like talkin'.

00:31:33.720 --> 00:31:34.913
It took me long enough just to get outta

00:31:34.913 --> 00:31:37.004
that goddamn house and start walkin'.

00:31:37.004 --> 00:31:37.930
(Louis laughs)

00:31:37.930 --> 00:31:39.830
I came down here and saw the car outside,

00:31:39.830 --> 00:31:41.407
I said, "This man get mad sometimes,

00:31:41.407 --> 00:31:44.160
"even though he wanna cut
somebody's motherfuckin' hide."

00:31:44.160 --> 00:31:46.439
So I came down the street,
about halfway down,

00:31:46.439 --> 00:31:48.740
he looked out the window,
he looked like a clown.

00:31:48.740 --> 00:31:50.037
I said, "Oh shit, I
better keep on walkin',

00:31:50.037 --> 00:31:51.320
"he may turn me away."

00:31:51.320 --> 00:31:53.730
He said, "No, no man, I
could use you on today."

00:31:53.730 --> 00:31:55.123
So I'm glad of that, I appreciate you,

00:31:55.123 --> 00:31:56.840
and I'm glad y'all could listen to me

00:31:56.840 --> 00:31:58.194
and I'll see you next time.

00:31:58.194 --> 00:32:03.194
(Louis laughs)
- [Interviewer] Thank you man.

